Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.71,0:03:53.88,sign_1165_chess_labels_bg,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\b1\fs30\an2\c&H8D8E8B&\fad(500,200)\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&H8D8E8B&\xshad-2\yshad-2\bord3\pos(337,166)}جناح الملكة
